    description: Some("A pair of eyes drifting through Zachary Graves\' pitch-dark mansion — 24 rooms across four floors — hunting the three scattered pieces of a magic urn and carrying them back to the entrance one at a time. Matches light a room for a moment, a master key opens the locked doors, and an old scepter wards off the bats and spiders, though not always the ghost."),
